1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,760
Ada satu lagi

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,730
hadis, riwayat

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,260
Bukhari.

4
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,460
At-tatha'ubu

5
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:14,780
minasy syaitan, menguap daripada syaitan.

6
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:18,480
Fa iza tatha'aba ahadukum, bila mana

7
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,650
menguap seseorang kamu, fal

8
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:24,160
yaruddahu mastata'a, maka hendaklah

9
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,460
dia menolak apa hak dia boleh,

10
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:30,180
ada hak dia

11
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:31,910
boleh.

12
00:00:31,910 --> 00:00:32,716
Fa inna ahadakum iza qala ha,

13
00:00:32,716 --> 00:00:34,640
dhahikasy syaitan.

14
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:38,340
Sesungguhnya seseorang kamu bila

15
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:43,400
menguap, haa, syaitan pun ketawa.

16
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,050
Mana kata lagu mana?

17
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,420
Jadi bila menguap atau tak tahan

18
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:51,980
hingga buka mulut,

19
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:55,340
bukan cakap buka mulut, bunyi pula

20
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:58,450
mulut, syaitan ketawa.

21
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:02,340
Satu lagi hadis, riwayat Ibnu Majah,

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:07,888
kata Nabi, fal yadha' yadahu 'ala

23
00:01:07,888 --> 00:01:10,360
fihi wala ya'wi.

24
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,520
Bila menguap, letak tangan atas mulut.

25
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:16,400
Wala ya'wi, jangan

26
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:18,270
bunyi.

27
00:01:18,630 --> 00:01:19,830
Ya'wi

28
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:22,130
ini asalnya

29
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:24,450
bunyi

30
00:01:25,580 --> 00:01:27,660
salakan serigala.

31
00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:34,500
Kita menguap,

32
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:36,260
wi.

33
00:01:36,194 --> 00:01:39,600
Menguap itu jadi macam anjing serigala.

34
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:41,580
Tapi jangan,

35
00:01:41,950 --> 00:01:47,030
wala ya'wi, jangan bunyi melolong,

36
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:50,550
seperti mana lolongan

37
00:01:51,050 --> 00:01:53,100
binatang, iaitu serigala.
